{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_title", "source_sha256": "784bcc19ce5ccea49b98772eae10826a6e26a62771f0ddf706c3d098fcdd5f2a", "ja": "君の心のフィルムに", "zh": "烙印在你心灵的胶片上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_synopsis", "source_sha256": "15a543540eb04a75a2d47a374d47cb597dac6b17692575954ca22efb9ff842cc", "ja": "プロデューサーがいなくなる夢を見てしまい\n大騒ぎする真。仕事で将来の夢について話す\nも、あまりピンと来ていない事を裏で告白。\nプロデューサーに歌いたい曲を問われ、改め\nて自分がどんな大人になりたいかを考える。", "zh": "真因为梦到制作人不见了而慌乱不已。虽然\n在工作中谈到了将来的梦想，私下却坦白自\n己其实没什么实感。被制作人问起想唱什么\n歌后，她重新思考起自己想成为怎样的大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ba6d5858ac7157ad7eb4c3f3b38ba5d7f13fe50e15251cbe6671fd16218c89a2", "ja": "（真の新曲お披露目公演が終わった。\n歌い終わった真の表情は、晴れ晴れとしている……）", "zh": "（真的新曲首演公演结束了。唱完歌的真，脸上洋溢着明朗的笑容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "d12b499d5d8ca86ef4f61d7d9cde3bab97eab2f54f8d695fb756c6e8906d663a", "ja": "菊地真の新曲で『セピアカラフル』でした！\n聴いてくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "以上为菊地真的新曲《复古多彩》！\n谢谢大家的聆听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "fe5aef65c89c191b46e6fb068c173aa637c5834c6bc582d3cda11d34bb0a6b35", "ja": "今回、大人っぽい曲を作らないかって話があって……\nそれで、ボクがお願いしたんです。", "zh": "这次有人提议要不要创作一首成熟风格的歌曲……\n所以，是我拜托他们的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "0aa2978e0038ae3b7642991d2beb8089b54b85ab7d95c6580d65cb92f7175fb5", "ja": "だったら、『別れ』を歌ってみたいって。", "zh": "既然这样，我想唱一首关于『离别』的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "58a99e81a4cc1b74c896035fe68d6e07cd6edd3f439c177510f84c5fea436b15", "ja": "えーっ、そうだったの！？", "zh": "诶——原来是这样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "edb41e10b175a03fc2e1cf4d996d1a1a6aef3d94bda604181eaee73c3460a693", "ja": "『別れ』なんて、とっても大人なテーマよね～！", "zh": "“离别”什么的，是非常成熟的主题呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "dae47a123330c9b1eae4207098d86c014294ff0423e947ff7569594640da3e7f", "ja": "真としては、どういう心境の変化だったの？", "zh": "对真来说，心境发生了怎样的变化呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "2cce4162a28cd4d930cf7148e20037ab5ce5f8d96bfc7dc861024f43d4dc7430", "ja": "えっと……ボクはまだ大人じゃないんだけど。でも\n自分では気づかないうちに、変わったところもあって。", "zh": "呃……我虽然还不是大人。不过，在自己没察觉的时候，也有了一些变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "bb33c01591e5f7149c374a7ce748c61bbc3be4307b759fe4530d1b86fec15aba", "ja": "うんうん。", "zh": "嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "f540d5f84daeae4f4afdc8cb2d50e023169a3bd76777d22de98806cc9ed539ac", "ja": "きっとこれからも、そんなふうに\n変わっていくことがあるんじゃないかって思ったんだ。", "zh": "我觉得今后一定也会有那样改变的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "b76a53f9879b2dee7e4fbfc09c5017cb27bfae2809384fee7357a61d131b8067", "ja": "せやな。自分が変わってってるかどうかなんて、\nそん時は気づかれへんもんな。", "zh": "是啊。自己有没有在改变，当时是不会察觉到的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "37156a6ca1eb2d380460860157d9a885c3a1897f66d30f31218e7e1b5ade9bc8", "ja": "その時、過去のボクのことを、懐かしいなって\n思うことがあるかもしれなくって……。", "zh": "到那时候，说不定会觉得过去的自己还真让人怀念……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "09f8e42a2c0060f5d33aebf2987f0586ea483a49fe22500d6b47797d11e374dc", "ja": "ふむふむ？", "zh": "嗯嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "2245052b4a994f4a336d677718a0e0fc0415455d82a059fe5f6d81c3d7dea740", "ja": "だから、えっと……ううっ、上手く言えないな～！\nとにかく、どんなボクも、全部ボクだってこと！", "zh": "所以，那个……呜，好难说清楚啊～！\n总之，不管是什么样的我，全都是我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "f1552d7430ec18093feab5d8413425c40433e07e3aba47d43443fe2ecd064183", "ja": "どんなボクであっても、その時のボク……\n菊地真を、大切に思ってくれた人がいるから。", "zh": "因为，无论是怎样的我，都有人珍惜那时的我……珍惜菊地真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "c016b2ae082662141704e4a8ebb01cddff4793f81b8136e62123f75b37581821", "ja": "ボクはこれからも、変わっていくかもしれない。\n……でも絶対に、大丈夫だから。", "zh": "我今后也可能会继续改变。\n……但绝对没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "daf4b4620e4b361f9d028f5f9d86360d172b3df203e5be8359b65cfc0c62d0bd", "ja": "どうかこれからも、ボクについてきてくださいっ！\n今日は本当に、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "今后也请一定要跟随我！  \n今天真的非常感谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1017_audience", "source_sha256": "f49d8e48c2d876b38ccf3a76021b4f504beb67b92ac6225f700b9df2c0c73a86", "ja": "ワアアアアアァァァァァ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2a55e882c501416e868e9d7dd2314e69bd1a4feefa0bbe768fc5736811ace4c6", "ja": "（真はこれからも変わっていくだろう。その事に、\n本人も周囲も、寂しさを覚える時が来るかもしれない）", "zh": "（真今后也会继续改变吧。或许有一天，她本人和身边的人都会为此感到寂寞。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_142_1019_p", "source_sha256": "da8d890afaaf3d242590be3e05a0b8bf201609cd7d22156cd3b0a46c91d58263", "ja": "（それでも、一番大切なものは変わらないはずだ。\n真がファンの人達を思う、その心だけは……）", "zh": "即便如此，最重要的东西应该不会改变。真对粉丝们的那份心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
